      <title>Poor Man's Polaroid</title>
      <link>https://boxart.lt/blog/poor_mans_polaroid</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Kažkodėl tai kainavo mažiau nei atskiros dalys. Pamiršau padaryti nuotrauką prieš pradėdamas lukštenti vieną iš spausdintuvų Norint prisijungti prie spausdintuvo, galima naudoti laidą arba bluetooth. Kitoje fotoaparato pusėje įtaisiau spausdintuvą, prag.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47258809"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HN Discussion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://boxart.lt/blog/poor_mans_polaroid'&gt;Read Original Article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top 9 Comments:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;voidUpdate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;Reminds me a lot of &lt;a href="https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;mitxela.com&amp;#x2F;projects&amp;#x2F;thermal_paper_polaroid" rel="nofollow"&gt;https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;mitxela.com&amp;#x2F;projects&amp;#x2F;thermal_paper_polaroid&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;thih9:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;Note that this is an existing product category, usually cheap too.&lt;p&gt;Lots of examples here: &lt;a href="https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;thermalprintcameras.wordpress.com" rel="nofollow"&gt;https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;thermalprintcameras.wordpress.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;Of course one can still want to hack something like this yourself for fun or other reasons.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;qsera:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;This is already available on online shops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;reconnecting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;ASCII filter is missing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baxtr:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;Nice project!&lt;p&gt;But this is definitely NOT for a poor man. Poor people buy a $20 camera on Amazon.&lt;p&gt;A time-rich person can afford this camera.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;mwidell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;Fun project. But if you just want the end result, you can buy one of these thermopaper toy cameras on Amazon for like $20.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;slysnuk:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;One should know that thermopaper contains Bisphenol A aka BPA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ashdnazg:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;If you&amp;#x27;re using mobile, there&amp;#x27;s an &amp;quot;English&amp;quot; button in the menu.&lt;p&gt;Note to website owner - it could be nice to have a permalink to the English version.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ivanvoid:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;this is a great idea and wonderful execution, inspiring others(me) to build one!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
